{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player protects a ball, while all the other players try to kick it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kick and Hide</strong> is a fast-paced asymmetric first-person multiplayer game for PC, played in groups of 4-6 people!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kick &amp; Hide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The round starts! <strong>Hiders</strong> rush the center, <strong>kick the ball</strong>, and scatter into the level to <strong>hide</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/c6d78216977570181bbf5deff1b6df70.poster.avif?t=1757593368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/c6d78216977570181bbf5deff1b6df70.webm?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/c6d78216977570181bbf5deff1b6df70.mp4?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retrieve &amp; Hunt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>seeker</strong> must <strong>retrieve the ball</strong>, <strong>return it to the center</strong>, and then<strong> begin hunting the hiders</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/18c423f0d5a0166a56f496a594f4594b.poster.avif?t=1757593368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/18c423f0d5a0166a56f496a594f4594b.webm?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/18c423f0d5a0166a56f496a594f4594b.mp4?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Capture &amp; Rescue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seeker <strong>captures</strong> hiders by visually <strong>tagging</strong> them and <strong>touching the ball at the center</strong>. Captured hiders are <strong>imprisoned</strong> near the ball, but a successful kick from a teammate <strong>frees everyone</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/39d940721632afd08dc7e0cc06c3511b.poster.avif?t=1757593368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/39d940721632afd08dc7e0cc06c3511b.webm?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/39d940721632afd08dc7e0cc06c3511b.mp4?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Win the Round</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiders win by scoring the <strong>most points from kicks</strong>. The seeker wins by <strong>capturing everyone before time runs out</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/af2c6506e9e3d9e8e6c6a9b6a600f328.poster.avif?t=1757593368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/af2c6506e9e3d9e8e6c6a9b6a600f328.webm?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/af2c6506e9e3d9e8e6c6a9b6a600f328.mp4?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a seeker, <strong>dash around</strong>, throw <strong>capture grenades</strong>, and <strong>sense</strong> hiders around you through walls! As a hider, respond with a <strong>stun grenade</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/64269baaa812c5b2dc09740676560b26.poster.avif?t=1757593368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/64269baaa812c5b2dc09740676560b26.webm?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/64269baaa812c5b2dc09740676560b26.mp4?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not convinced?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Asymmetric Fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The powered-up seeker and the less powerful hiders create two completely different gameplay experiences in one game. It's a true test of power vs. wits and numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Evasion &amp; Map Mastery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiders have limited abilities, so winning depends on pure player skill: mastering movement, learning level layouts, and coordinating with teammates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for Laughs &amp; Friendly Rivalry</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tWith fast, ~3-minute rounds and hilarious, unpredictable physics, Kick and Hide is built from the ground up to create memorable moments, epic fails, and heroic plays among friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability, Low Friction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Simple-to-learn rules mean anyone can jump in, but a high skill ceiling in both roles keeps dedicated players coming back for &quot;just one more round.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698510?t=1757593368","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/57003e2b4b92c81d28d86c6b1564f9c581292847/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757593368","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/da2cb478162908d5130b7744288c7adcb44cfca9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757593368","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/da2cb478162908d5130b7744288c7adcb44cfca9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757593368","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3873050,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player protects a ball, while all the other players try to kick it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kick and Hide</strong> is a fast-paced asymmetric first-person multiplayer game for PC, played in groups of 4-6 people!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kick &amp; Hide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The round starts! <strong>Hiders</strong> rush the center, <strong>kick the ball</strong>, and scatter into the level to <strong>hide</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/c6d78216977570181bbf5deff1b6df70.poster.avif?t=1757593368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/c6d78216977570181bbf5deff1b6df70.webm?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/c6d78216977570181bbf5deff1b6df70.mp4?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retrieve &amp; Hunt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>seeker</strong> must <strong>retrieve the ball</strong>, <strong>return it to the center</strong>, and then<strong> begin hunting the hiders</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/18c423f0d5a0166a56f496a594f4594b.poster.avif?t=1757593368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/18c423f0d5a0166a56f496a594f4594b.webm?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/18c423f0d5a0166a56f496a594f4594b.mp4?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Capture &amp; Rescue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seeker <strong>captures</strong> hiders by visually <strong>tagging</strong> them and <strong>touching the ball at the center</strong>. Captured hiders are <strong>imprisoned</strong> near the ball, but a successful kick from a teammate <strong>frees everyone</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/39d940721632afd08dc7e0cc06c3511b.poster.avif?t=1757593368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/39d940721632afd08dc7e0cc06c3511b.webm?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/39d940721632afd08dc7e0cc06c3511b.mp4?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Win the Round</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiders win by scoring the <strong>most points from kicks</strong>. The seeker wins by <strong>capturing everyone before time runs out</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/af2c6506e9e3d9e8e6c6a9b6a600f328.poster.avif?t=1757593368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/af2c6506e9e3d9e8e6c6a9b6a600f328.webm?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/af2c6506e9e3d9e8e6c6a9b6a600f328.mp4?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a seeker, <strong>dash around</strong>, throw <strong>capture grenades</strong>, and <strong>sense</strong> hiders around you through walls! As a hider, respond with a <strong>stun grenade</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/64269baaa812c5b2dc09740676560b26.poster.avif?t=1757593368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/64269baaa812c5b2dc09740676560b26.webm?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/extras/64269baaa812c5b2dc09740676560b26.mp4?t=1757593368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not convinced?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Asymmetric Fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The powered-up seeker and the less powerful hiders create two completely different gameplay experiences in one game. It's a true test of power vs. wits and numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Evasion &amp; Map Mastery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiders have limited abilities, so winning depends on pure player skill: mastering movement, learning level layouts, and coordinating with teammates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for Laughs &amp; Friendly Rivalry</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tWith fast, ~3-minute rounds and hilarious, unpredictable physics, Kick and Hide is built from the ground up to create memorable moments, epic fails, and heroic plays among friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability, Low Friction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Simple-to-learn rules mean anyone can jump in, but a high skill ceiling in both roles keeps dedicated players coming back for &quot;just one more round.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Stolen Heater"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/23f0c70598d72147d208c42192e6bb46acdd4291/header.jpg?t=1757593368","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257176277,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176277/movie480.mp4?t=1753975357","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176277/movie_max.mp4?t=1753975357"},"name":"Demo Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co